<title>USA: Charter One rescinds stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Charter One rescinds stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter One Financial Inc said on Friday it has rescinded its stock repurchase plan, since it has a pending merger with RCSB Financial Inc.</p>
<p>Charter One has 865,458 shares remaining unpurchased in its current five percent stock repurchase program that was authorized in May 1996, Charter One said.</p>
<p>Charter One currently has 46.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
